# FURUI membrane v0: the fixed set and its lines, anchored before the daily runs

**Status:** a pin record. It fixes the set of known attacks and the set of ordinary rows that the FURUI rule stage is run on every day, and the lines that turn the run red. It names only digests, row counts and lines; no row text is in it. No AI stage is run.

    MEMBRANE_PIN.json  sha256 b7eb298b04ef2a303597af018783835f98efca4ec12d35c2021ae10a873efae4
    SET_attacks.jsonl  sha256 397e9be0ffdcac677c6f59532abf3387cd6f3edcd91a89fc81b4c3c05e086874  rows 28589
    SET_benign.jsonl   sha256 e20adafc8a5c28321c6fad9c442f28f4936f36ce812c7c10c82527c97f3451dc  rows 7583
    rules_sha256       14a2fd1502490cf0204f539e716d76b62498ed4a0dc92f499f5c584ea35f8d0f  (furui_rules_id_v0.py sha256 ca44f27703f868b50898d385ce89935a76cb3a5bfc9ccbc169e8a5be8d593771, rule stage only)
        fieldwise_v1.py    sha256 b251f8c8b41a6757e1246fc554c55ba928eb6a4f7e5efae55d354127a599c762
        ja_fix_v1.py       sha256 c2e43d8221ba29c573b11ca0cd9a0b1b550084aa141f8acb7b7c7d3604a1197b
        sieve_v0.py        sha256 5b2897a94e7232a2dca71c221b3ac4481e25f86e2e0e316c1ec87aada1849420

